<title>SRI LANKA: Grain Elevators jumps on earnings hopes.</title>
<headline>Grain Elevators jumps on earnings hopes.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceylon Grain Elevators Ltd rose 10 percent or 1.50 rupees to 16 rupees on Friday, on turnover of 13,000 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The company is expected to perform well in 1997, after being hit by power cuts and high world grain prices in 1996,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>The company mills animal feed and farms day-old chicks.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
